    "html": "<p>Two particles, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, are in uniform circular motion. Particle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> moves in a circle of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> with a period <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> moves in a circle of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2r\"></span> with a period <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3T\"></span>. What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\text{centripetal acceleration of } X}{\\text{centripetal acceleration of } Y}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.22\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.5\"></span></p></li></ol>"
